cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-fast in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-fast: a native validation core for pain001"
abstract: >-
  A native (Rust, PyO3) extension for the pain001 ISO 20022 ecosystem
  that validates IBANs, BICs, restricted-character-set text and
  batches of payment records; pain001's IBAN, BIC and character-set checks use it when it is
  installed.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.87"
date-released: "2026-11-12"
